WEBVTT

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:00.389
I was so confused.

00:01:00.765 --> 00:01:04.477
But I was a kid, so I took the candy,
and I started chewing.

00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:10.066
God, I felt like I had just been inducted
into the coolest club possible.

00:01:10.608 --> 00:01:13.194
The one that eats candy
on a random Wednesday.

00:01:13.194 --> 00:01:14.654
(Laughs)

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:18.825
And then the world, it slowed down.

00:01:19.325 --> 00:01:20.910
Everything faded.

00:01:21.869 --> 00:01:23.621
And then everything sharpened.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.834
There is only one word
for what I felt in that moment.

00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:29.460
Magic.

00:01:29.502 --> 00:01:31.212
Real magic.